"All four variants of the revenant goblin have the same drops, but as revenant drop chances depend on the combat level of the revenant, the chances change between the variants.\
\
Revenant drops are not affected by luck. There are only two ways to increase the drop rate of revenant items: completion of the elite Wilderness achievements which gives a 5% increased chance for revenant drops, and revenant drop enhancers, which give a 10% increased chance. Both boosts can be in effect at the same time.\
\
The ghostlevel used to calculate the drop rates of the level 16 revenant goblin's unique items is 4, and the revnumber is 15000. Drop chances are increased by 5% if elite Wilderness achievements are completed, and by 10% if the revenant drop enhancer in the backpack or currency pouch, stacks with the former.",
